The best way to deal with nymphs once they have taken stuff is to stay in
a largish room, dig a pit in the space in front of each door where the
nymph would step to go to you, and do a 5. (5 period) to wait repeatedly.  
When the nymph falls into the pit, peg it with missile weapons until it 
expires.  Maybe dig a row of pits for extra security.

I've also noticed that when you're in a large room and you're throwing stuff
at the nymph, very commonly she'll wander around picking up the arrows/daggers/
darts that didn't hit her until she's been pinked to death.

In a related vein, one way of dealing with orc hordes is to put a dart under
a boulder; 3 or 4 of the orcs will mill around trying to get at that gosh
darn dart, so you can slay them in a lesiurely manner.

